        "question_text": "<p>Solve the quadratic equation $x^2 - 5x + 6 = 0$ by factorization.</p>",
        "question_image": null,
        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Factorize the quadratic equation:<br>$x^2 - 5x + 6 = (x - 2)(x - 3) = 0$.<br>Set each factor equal to zero:<br>$x - 2 = 0 \\implies x = 2$<br>$x - 3 = 0 \\implies x = 3$.<br>The solutions are $x = 2$ and $x = 3$.</p>",
