        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>Differentiate term by term:<br>$\\frac{d}{dx}(3x^3) = 9x^2$<br>$\\frac{d}{dx}(-2x^2) = -4x$<br>$\\frac{d}{dx}(5x) = 5$<br>$\\frac{d}{dx}(-7) = 0$<br>Thus, $f'(x) = 9x^2 - 4x + 5$.</p>",
